  "details": "The new beta adds a banner to advertise the updated Live Now section with dynamic thumbnails and an instance count, but it takes up so much space the ENTIRE quick menu was made taller to fit it.\n\nI have a proposal that would still keep the new info: remove the banner and move the dynamic elements into the existing Live Now button.\n\nThe first image is the Open Beta layout, the second image is a mockup of my suggestion.",
